    "question_hi": "What is the difference between on() and once() in EventEmitter?",
    "answer_hi": "Both methods attach an event listener function:\n- **`emitter.on(event, listener)`:** Registers a listener that executes **every time** the event is emitted until explicitly removed.\n- **`emitter.once(event, listener)`:** Registers a one-time listener that executes **only the first time** the event is emitted, and is immediately detached thereafter.",
