    "answer_en": "- **`app.use([path], middleware)`:** Mounts middleware functions for **all** HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) that match the path prefix. It is used for global tasks like parsing bodies, setting CORS, logging, or sub-routers.\n- **`app.get(path, handler)`:** Handles **only** incoming HTTP GET requests that match the exact specified route path.",
