    "question_hi": "What is PM2 and why is it used in production?",
    "answer_hi": "PM2 is a production process manager for Node.js applications. In production, if an uncaught exception crashes `node server.js`, the process terminates. PM2 provides:\n1. **Auto-restart:** Automatically restarts the app upon crashes or server reboots.\n2. **Cluster Mode:** Spins up instances equal to the number of CPU cores without code changes.\n3. **Zero-downtime reloads:** Seamless rolling updates.\n4. **Log management & resource monitoring.**",
