    "question_hi": "What is a CI/CD pipeline for a Node.js backend?",
    "answer_hi": "CI/CD (Continuous Integration / Continuous Deployment) automates the path from code commit to production release:\n- **CI (Continuous Integration):** Automatically installs dependencies, runs linters, and executes unit/integration test suites on every pull request (e.g., via GitHub Actions).\n- **CD (Continuous Deployment):** If CI passes and code merges to `main`, the pipeline automatically builds Docker images, runs database migrations, and deploys the new code to cloud servers without manual intervention.",
